and I believe that you have

00:00:04.266 --> 00:00:06.345
something special, that
when you unleash it,

00:00:06.345 --> 00:00:08.711
it will be able to change the world.

00:00:08.711 --> 00:00:09.851
So to help you on your journey,

00:00:09.851 --> 00:00:13.224
today's message is
practice public speaking.

00:00:13.224 --> 00:00:14.814
Over to you, Warren Buffet.

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:16.975
