Robb, thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:03:58.839 --> 00:04:01.415
Your One Word, I really
appreciate the support man,

00:04:01.415 --> 00:04:03.606
and I hope you're enjoying the read.

00:04:03.606 --> 00:04:04.772
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:04:04.772 --> 00:04:07.182
I believe in you, I hope
you continue to believe

00:04:07.182 --> 00:04:09.775
